              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "55aaf4d3-f7e3-4a3e-9196-01a6f7474f94"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582782,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Political Awakening</strong><br>\nReagan's political views shifted from liberal to conservative during his Hollywood years. His time as president of the Screen Actors Guild (SAG) saw him dealing with issues of communist influence in the film industry and the power of big studios, which contributed to his political evolution. He became an outspoken member of the Republican Party by the early 1960s.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Governor of California</strong><br>\nIn 1966, Reagan was elected Governor of California and served two terms until 1975. His governorship was marked by efforts to decrease state spending, confront student protests, and regulate the environment. He faced criticism and praise for his handling of the state's affairs, setting the stage for national political aspirations.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Presidential Campaigns</strong><br>\nReagan unsuccessfully ran for the Republican presidential nomination in 1968 and 1976. He used these campaigns to outline his conservative platform, which included reducing government's role in people's lives, strengthening national defense, and restoring American pride and morale after the Vietnam War and Watergate scandal.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "3b13867b-feab-4e2e-bfa2-fcc82e4dbff1"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
